"txt",
"<!doctype html>\n<html lang=\"ko\">\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"utf-8\">\n<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1\">\n<title>KNEXM | 케이넥스엠주식회사 — Brands, made to last.</title>\n<meta name=\"description\" content=\"KNEXM(케이넥스엠)은 프리미엄 브랜드를 기획하고 만들고 유통하는 브랜드 하우스입니다. 지크나인, 카도프, 야케노, 테오랭스와 파란소리, DownKit을 만듭니다.\">\n<link rel=\"canonical\" href=\"https://knexm.com/\">\n<meta property=\"og:type\" content=\"website\">\n<meta property=\"og:site_name\" content=\"KNEXM\">\n<meta property=\"og:title\" content=\"KNEXM | 케이넥스엠주식회사 — Brands, made to last.\">\n<meta property=\"og:description\" content=\"KNEXM(케이넥스엠)은 프리미엄 브랜드를 기획하고 만들고 유통하는 브랜드 하우스입니다. 지크나인, 카도프, 야케노, 테오랭스와 파란소리, DownKit을 만듭니다.\">\n<meta property=\"og:url\" content=\"https://knexm.com/\">\n<meta property=\"og:image\" content=\"https://knexm.com/assets/og-image.png\">\n<meta property=\"og:image:width\" content=\"1200\">\n<meta property=\"og:image:height\" content=\"630\">\n<meta property=\"og:locale\" content=\"ko_KR\">\n<meta name=\"twitter:card\" content=\"summary_large_image\">\n<meta name=\"theme-color\" content=\"#ffffff\">\n<link rel=\"icon\" href=\"assets/favicon.svg\" type=\"image/svg+xml\">\n<link rel=\"preconnect\" href=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net\" crossorigin>\n<link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/orioncactus/pretendard@v1.3.9/dist/web/variable/pretendardvariable-dynamic-subset.min.css\">\n<link rel=\"preconnect\" href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com\">\n<link rel=\"preconnect\" href=\"https://fonts.gstatic.com\" crossorigin>\n<link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Cormorant+Garamond:ital,wght@1,500&amp;display=swap\">\n<link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"assets/style.css\">\n</head>\n<body>\n<a class=\"skip\" href=\"#main\">본문 바로가기</a>\n<header class=\"site-header\" id=\"top\">\n  <div class=\"wrap\">\n    <a class=\"logo\" href=\"./\" aria-label=\"KNEXM 홈\">KNEXM</a>\n    <nav class=\"nav\" aria-label=\"주 메뉴\">\n      <a href=\"company/\">회사소개</a>\n      <a href=\"#brands\">브랜드</a>\n      <a href=\"#how\">일하는 방식</a>\n      <a href=\"#digital\">디지털</a>\n      <a href=\"#partners\">파트너십</a>\n    </nav>\n    <div class=\"header-cta\">\n      <a class=\"btn btn-line\" href=\"mailto:info@knexm.com\">문의하기</a>\n      <button class=\"menu-btn\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"메뉴 열기\" aria-expanded=\"false\" aria-controls=\"mobile-nav\">\n        <svg class=\"i-open\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.8\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M4 8h16M4 16h16\"></path></svg>\n        <svg class=\"i-close\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.8\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\" style=\"display:none\"><path d=\"M6 6l12 12M18 6L6 18\"></path></svg>\n      </button>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</header>\n<nav class=\"mobile-nav\" id=\"mobile-nav\" aria-label=\"모바일 메뉴\">\n    <a href=\"company/\">회사소개</a>\n    <a href=\"#brands\">브랜드</a>\n    <a href=\"#how\">일하는 방식</a>\n    <a href=\"#digital\">디지털</a>\n    <a href=\"#partners\">파트너십</a>\n    <a class=\"btn btn-dark\" href=\"mailto:info@knexm.com\">문의하기 <svg aria-hidden=\"true\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.8\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><path d=\"M5 12h14M13 6l6 6-6 6\"></path></svg></a>\n</nav>\n<main id=\"main\">\n  <section class=\"hero\">\n    <div class=\"wrap\">\n      <div class=\"hero-text\">\n        <div>\n          <span class=\"eyebrow\">KNEXM — BRAND HOUSE, SEOUL</span>\n          <h1 lang=\"en\">Brands,<br>made to <span class=\"serif\">last.</span></h1>\n        </div>\n        <div>\n          <p class=\"hero-sub\">기획에서 생산, 유통과 운영까지.<br>브랜드가 태어나 오래 머무는 모든 과정을 직접 설계합니다.</p>\n          <a class=\"link-under\" href=\"#brands\">브랜드 둘러보기 <svg aria-hidden=\"true\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.8\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><path d=\"M12 5v14M6 13l6 6 6-6\"></path></svg></a>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"tiles\">\n        <a class=\"tile t1\" href=\"#brands\"><small>01 · LIFE GEAR</small><b lang=\"en\">ZEEKNINE</b></a>\n        <a class=\"tile t2\" href=\"#brands\"><small>02 · WORKGEAR</small><b lang=\"en\">KADOFF</b></a>\n        <a class=\"tile t3\" href=\"#brands\"><small>03 · SOUND</small><b lang=\"en\">YAKENO</b></a>\n        <a class=\"tile t4\" href=\"#brands\"><small>04 · LUXURY LIFESTYLE</small><b class=\"serif\" lang=\"en\">Théo Lance</b></a>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </section>\n\n  <section class=\"how\" id=\"how\">\n    <div class=\"wrap\">\n      <div class=\"section-head\">\n        <h2 class=\"h2\">생각에서 일상까지,<br>한 호흡으로.</h2>\n        <p class=\"lead\">브랜드의 처음과 끝을 나누지 않습니다. 기획한 손이 끝까지 책임질 때, 제품은 더 오래 사랑받습니다.</p>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"steps\">\n        <div class=\"step reveal\">\n          <div class=\"step-top\"><span class=\"step-no\">01</span><span class=\"step-line\"></span></div>\n          <small>PLANNING</small>\n          <h3>기획</h3>\n          <p>이름과 이야기, 제품이 놓일 자리를 먼저 그립니다.</p>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"step reveal\">\n          <div class=\"step-top\"><span class=\"step-no\">02</span><span class=\"step-line\"></span></div>\n          <small>MAKING</small>\n          <h3>생산</h3>\n          <p>검증된 파트너와 함께, 오래 쓰는 품질을 만듭니다.</p>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"step reveal\">\n          <div class=\"step-top\"><span class=\"step-no\">03</span><span class=\"step-line\"></span></div>\n          <small>DISTRIBUTION</small>\n          <h3>유통</h3>\n          <p>국내외 채널을 통해 필요한 곳에 정확히 닿게 합니다.</p>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"step reveal\">\n          <div class=\"step-top\"><span class=\"step-no\">04</span><span class=\"step-line\"></span></div>\n          <small>OPERATING</small>\n          <h3>운영</h3>\n          <p>데이터로 듣고 다듬으며, 브랜드를 계속 자라게 합니다.</p>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </section>\n\n  <section class=\"brands\" id=\"brands\">\n    <div class=\"wrap\">\n      <div class=\"section-head\">\n        <div>\n          <span class=\"eyebrow\">OUR BRANDS</span>\n          <h2 class=\"h2\">결이 다른 네 개의 브랜드</h2>\n        </div>\n        <p class=\"lead\">같은 기준, 다른 개성. 각 브랜드는 저마다의 목소리로 일상의 한 장면을 맡습니다.</p>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"brand-list\">\n      <div class=\"brand reveal\">\n        <span class=\"brand-no\">01</span>\n        <span class=\"brand-name\"><span class=\"dot\" style=\"background:#1b1d1c\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span><span class=\"word w1\" lang=\"en\">ZEEKNINE</span></span>\n        <div class=\"brand-info\">\n          <b>지크나인 <span>· Premium Life Gear</span></b>\n          <p>단단함을 일상의 기준으로. 자전거·보안·아웃도어를 위한 라이프 기어.</p>\n          <small>BUILT · TRUSTED · REFINED</small>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"brand reveal\">\n        <span class=\"brand-no\">02</span>\n        <span class=\"brand-name\"><span class=\"dot\" style=\"background:#8c7a66\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span><span class=\"word w2\" lang=\"en\">KADOFF</span></span>\n        <div class=\"brand-info\">\n          <b>카도프 <span>· Industrial Workgear</span></b>\n          <p>현장이 먼저 알아보는 무게. 프로를 위한 산업용 툴과 워크기어.</p>\n          <small>INDUSTRIAL · TOUGH · HEAVY DUTY</small>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"brand reveal\">\n        <span class=\"brand-no\">03</span>\n        <span class=\"brand-name\"><span class=\"dot\" style=\"background:#b9b9b4\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span><span class=\"word w3\" lang=\"en\">YAKENO</span></span>\n        <div class=\"brand-info\">\n          <b>야케노 <span>· Sound · Minimal Tech</span></b>\n          <p>덜어낼수록 선명해지는 소리. 미니멀 사운드 &amp; 테크.</p>\n          <small>MINIMAL · PRECISE · QUIET</small>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"brand reveal\">\n        <span class=\"brand-no\">04</span>\n        <span class=\"brand-name\"><span class=\"dot\" style=\"background:#e3cfc5\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span><span class=\"word w4 serif\" lang=\"en\">Théo Lance</span></span>\n        <div class=\"brand-info\">\n          <b>테오랭스 <span>· Women's Luxury Lifestyle</span></b>\n          <p>일상에 스미는 우아함. 여성을 위한 럭셔리 라이프스타일.</p>\n          <small>ELEGANT · FEMININE · REFINED</small>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </section>\n\n  <section class=\"digital\" id=\"digital\">\n    <div class=\"wrap\">\n      <div class=\"digital-in\">\n        <div class=\"digital-text\">\n          <span class=\"eyebrow\">DIGITAL</span>\n          <h2 class=\"h2\">제품 너머,<br>손안의 경험까지.</h2>\n          <p class=\"lead\">KNEXM은 우리가 먼저 쓰고 싶은 서비스를 만듭니다. 기획과 디자인, 개발과 운영까지 모두 직접. 브랜드에 담아 온 기준을 디지털에도 그대로 옮깁니다.</p>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"apps\">\n          <div class=\"app\">\n            <div><b>파란소리</b><span>음악, 라디오, 자연의 소리를 하나의 앱에 · Android</span></div>\n            <a class=\"btn btn-dark\" href=\"https://ssing.kr/app\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">바로 다운로드 <svg aria-hidden=\"true\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><path d=\"M7 17L17 7M9 7h8v8\"></path></svg></a>\n          </div>\n          <div class=\"app\">\n            <div><b>DownKit (다운킷)</b><span>미디어 저장과 편집을 위한 스튜디오 · Windows · Android</span></div>\n            <a class=\"btn btn-dark\" href=\"https://downkit.net\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">사이트 가기 <svg aria-hidden=\"true\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><path d=\"M7 17L17 7M9 7h8v8\"></path></svg></a>\n          </div>\n          <div class=\"app\">\n            <div><b>메디컬·라이프스타일 모바일 서비스</b><span>일상과 헬스케어를 잇는 새로운 서비스</span></div>\n            <span class=\"tag\" lang=\"en\">BUILDING</span>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </section>\n\n  <section class=\"partners\" id=\"partners\">\n    <div class=\"wrap\">\n      <div class=\"partners-text\">\n        <span class=\"eyebrow\">PARTNERSHIP</span>\n        <h2 class=\"h2\">함께 만들 파트너를 찾습니다.</h2>\n        <p class=\"lead\">유통, OEM·ODM, 브랜드 협업까지. 새로운 기회라면 언제든 편하게 이야기해 주세요.</p>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"partners-cta\">\n        <a class=\"btn btn-dark\" href=\"mailto:info@knexm.com\">제휴 문의하기 <svg aria-hidden=\"true\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.8\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><path d=\"M5 12h14M13 6l6 6-6 6\"></path></svg></a>\n        <span>info@knexm.com · 1688-5372</span>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </section>\n</main>\n<footer class=\"site-footer\" id=\"contact\">\n  <div class=\"wrap\">\n    <div class=\"f-top\">\n      <div>\n        <small>LET'S WORK TOGETHER</small>\n        <strong>좋은 브랜드는<br>오래 남습니다.</strong>\n      </div>\n      <a class=\"f-circle\" href=\"mailto:info@knexm.com\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" width=\"26\" height=\"26\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><path d=\"M7 17L17 7M9 7h8v8\"></path></svg>문의하기</a>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"f-cols\">\n      <div class=\"f-col\">\n        <small>BRANDS</small>\n        <a class=\"fb1\" href=\"#brands\">ZEEKNINE</a>\n        <a class=\"fb2\" href=\"#brands\">KADOFF</a>\n        <a class=\"fb3\" href=\"#brands\">YAKENO</a>\n        <a class=\"fb4 serif\" href=\"#brands\">Théo Lance</a>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"f-col\">\n        <small>MENU</small>\n        <a href=\"company/\">회사소개</a>\n        <a href=\"#how\">일하는 방식</a>\n        <a href=\"#digital\">디지털</a>\n        <a href=\"#partners\">파트너십</a>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"f-col\">\n        <small>CONTACT</small>\n        <a href=\"tel:1688-5372\">1688-5372</a>\n        <a href=\"mailto:info@knexm.com\">info@knexm.com</a>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"f-col office\">\n        <small>OFFICE</small>\n        <span>서울특별시 강남구 일원로35<br>남경빌딩 5층 5830호</span>\n        <span>케이넥스엠주식회사 · 대표 윤여울<br>사업자등록번호 878-88-03505</span>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"f-bottom\">\n      <span>© 2026 KNEXM Co., Ltd. All rights reserved.</span>\n      <div class=\"f-links\">\n        <a href=\"privacy/\">개인정보처리방침</a>\n        <a href=\"terms/\">이용약관</a>\n        <a class=\"to-top\" href=\"#top\" aria-label=\"맨 위로\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" width=\"18\" height=\"18\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.6\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><path d=\"M12 19V5M6 11l6-6 6 6\"></path></svg></a>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"f-mark\" aria-hidden=\"true\">KNEXM</div>\n</footer>\n<script src=\"assets/site.js\"></script>\n</body>\n</html>\n"
